# The fund's only Pi jobs once it runs on the Mac Studio (deploy/MIGRATE-TO-MAC.md).
# Install with: deploy/pi-crontab.sh watchdog. It adds these lines beside the rest of
# the crontab (DeepSwing's jobs live there too). Never `crontab` this file directly,
# because that would replace the whole table.
#
# Checks only while the Mac must be awake: 08:45 (before the first stops check at 09:00)
# to 22:15 (after the last US one), well inside its trading-day window (ai-studio config
# power.windows, weekdays 07:00-23:59). Outside a window the Mac is asleep on purpose and
# silence is not an outage. Keep these inside the window if you ever narrow it.
# Times are Europe/Stockholm (sudo timedatectl set-timezone Europe/Stockholm).

45 8 * * 1-5      cd /home/alexander/Documents/ai-fund-manager && deploy/watchdog.sh >> data/logs/watchdog.log 2>&1
*/15 9-21 * * 1-5 cd /home/alexander/Documents/ai-fund-manager && deploy/watchdog.sh >> data/logs/watchdog.log 2>&1
0,15 22 * * 1-5   cd /home/alexander/Documents/ai-fund-manager && deploy/watchdog.sh >> data/logs/watchdog.log 2>&1
